# ClearClick AI Environment Variables
# AI features are modular: if no key is supplied, ClearClick AI functions entirely offline
# using deterministic rule detectors and heuristic pattern checks with zero errors.

# Optional: Claude (Anthropic) API Key for Phase 4 text & vision evaluation
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=your_anthropic_api_key_here

# Optional: Google Gemini API Key
# GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
